    "title"            "Infinite Capacity / 无限容量"
    "description"      "[h1]Infinite Capacity[/h1]
Separately controls character carry weight, item-transfer weight limits, and vehicle cargo mass. Drag-and-drop, Loot All, and “Put in Container...” remain available.

[h2]1. Carry Weight[/h2]
• Adjustable from the built-in Settings → Mods page and synchronized with sandbox settings
• Vanilla / Custom limit (1–10000) / Unlimited
• Controls the character's real native maximum weight, Heavy Load status, displayed limit, and character-inventory transfer limit
• Written once when the player enters the world; no polling or periodic overwrite

[h2]2. Transfer Weight[/h2]
• Vanilla / Original-weight multiplier (1–100×) / Unlimited
• Controls whether items can be moved into bags, world containers, and vehicle containers
• Separate toggles for bags, world containers, and vehicle containers
• Preserves item-type rules, per-item bag size, and in-vehicle heavy-item restrictions

[h2]3. Vehicle Cargo Mass[/h2]
• Optionally prevents stored cargo from increasing vehicle physics mass; enabled by default
• Installed vehicle parts still contribute to vehicle mass

[h2]Settings and compatibility[/h2]
• Multiplayer settings are controlled by the server's sandbox configuration; regular players have read-only controls
• Defaults remain unlimited to preserve the behavior of previous releases
• Updated against Project Zomboid Build 42.20.4 stable
• Build 41 retains the original all-unlimited compatibility mode
• Multiplayer requires the mod on both server and clients
• Preserves trading, safehouse, and transaction checks
• Floor-item safety and ItemNumbersLimitPerContainer remain vanilla

[h2]Credits[/h2]
The concept combines Remove Loot Restriction (Workshop 2885648642) and Bypass Container Capacity Limit (Workshop 3396168708).

[hr][/hr]

[h1]无限容量[/h1]
分别控制人物携带重量、物品转移重量限制和车辆货物质量。拖放、全部拾取和右键“放入容器……”均可正常使用。

[h2]1. 携带重量[/h2]
• 可在系统自带的“设置 → 模组”页面直接调整，并与沙盒设置同步
• 原版 / 自定义上限（1–10000）/ 无限
• 控制人物真实的原生最大负重、超重状态、界面显示上限以及人物物品栏的转移上限
• 进入世界时写入一次，不轮询、不周期覆盖

[h2]2. 转移重量[/h2]
• 原版 / 原始重量上限倍率（1–100 倍）/ 无限
• 控制物品能否放入背包、世界容器和车辆容器
• 可分别控制背包与手提包、世界容器、车辆容器
• 保留物品类型、背包单件尺寸和车内重物限制

[h2]3. 车辆货物质量[/h2]
• 可让车辆容器中的货物不计入整车物理质量，默认开启
• 已安装的车辆部件仍会计入整车质量

[h2]设置与兼容性[/h2]
• 多人游戏由服务器沙盒设置统一控制；普通玩家只读
• 默认仍为角色和容器无限，更新后保持旧版行为
• 已按 Project Zomboid Build 42.20.4 正式版更新
• Build 41 保留原有的全部无限兼容模式
• 多人游戏需要服务器和客户端同时安装并启用
• 保留交易、保险屋及多人交易一致性检查
• 地面物品安全限制及 ItemNumbersLimitPerContainer 服务器上限保持原版

[h2]鸣谢[/h2]
功能构想结合了 Remove Loot Restriction（工坊 2885648642）和 Bypass Container Capacity Limit（工坊 3396168708）。

[h2]IDs / 编号[/h2]
Workshop ID: 3546219719
Mod ID: RemoveCapacityAndPickUpLimits"
    "changenote"       "Updated for Build 42.20.4. Fixed ordinary multiplayer players still receiving Heavy Load at the displayed custom capacity. Fixed vehicle cargo still increasing Bullet physics mass when cargo-mass exclusion is enabled. Fixed bulk transfers stopping only slightly above a container's original capacity: configured containers now recheck each queued item and switch to the authoritative transfer path when the native limit is crossed. Vanilla mode keeps native transfer batching. No polling, timers, or periodic overwrites.

适配 Build 42.20.4。修复普通多人玩家在界面显示自定义容量后仍按原版上限进入超重状态；修复开启“货物不计入整车质量”后，货物仍增加 Bullet 物理质量的问题；修复批量转移只能略微超过容器原始容量的问题：启用扩容的容器会逐件按最新重量检查，并在跨过原生上限时切换到服务器权威转移。原版模式仍保留原生批量合并。无轮询、无定时器、无周期覆盖。"
}
